WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.850
Dad and Hada were at the airport to pick us up.

2
00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:09.795
It was wonderful to see them.

3
00:00:09.796 --> 00:00:12.945
Dad: Hana! Bada! Over here!

4
00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.667
Hana & Bada: Daddy!

5
00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:16.316
Dad: Welcome

6
00:00:16.317 --> 00:00:20.474
home! Mom: It’s good to be

7
00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:22.460
home. Bada: We’re

8
00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:26.180
home! Hana: Oh, how I missed

9
00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:29.464
you! Mom: Take your suitcases into your rooms,

10
00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:31.877
kids. Dad: I’ll help

11
00:00:31.878 --> 00:00:34.791
you. What was your favorite part of the trip?

12
00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:37.189
Bada: Going to Disneyland!

13
00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:40.153
Hana: I liked the cable car ride.

14
00:00:40.154 --> 00:00:44.318
Mom: For me, it was the wedding.

15
00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:46.551
Dad: Did you like San

16
00:00:46.552 --> 00:00:49.861
Francisco? Bada: Yes! I want to go

17
00:00:49.862 --> 00:00:52.932
back! Hana: But we missed you and

18
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:58.305
Hada! Dad: Next time we can all go

19
00:00:58.306 --> 00:01:00.840
together. Thank you, Hana. I love it!

20
00:01:00.841 --> 00:01:03.054
Mom: This is for Hada.

21
00:01:03.055 --> 00:01:06.066
Hana: I loved going to San Francisco.

22
00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:10.580
But this is my home sweet home! Bada:

23
00:01:10.581 --> 00:01:13.367
